        "original_author": "",
        "original_author_id": 0,
        "title": "Proposal : Exclude labels",
        "body": "It would be useful to be able to exclude some labels just like in the web interface, maybe with something like\r\n\r\n`--label !name1 !name2 ` or `--xlabel names`\r\n\r\nand the returned issues/pr would have none of these labels.\r\n\r\nAnother option would be to do like github cli for compatibility reasons `gh pr list --search \"-label:<label>\"` (https://github.com/cli/cli/discussions/4142) although I think that it would be a more complicated way to do so.\r\n\r\nCheers",
